}}'''Pool Noodle''' is a [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 3,200 [[Beach Balls (currency)|Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} during the [[Summer Event 2023]]. It is now only available through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. Its blade is a textured blue to resemble the styrofoam material of a pool noodle, hence the name. Its guard is green and the handle is bright yellow.

